The Sovereign Leviathan Covenant

Hark! Ye who seek to bind this sovereign code,
And reap the harvest of a builder's toil,
Know well the terms upon this digital road,
Lest corporate greed become a ruined spoil.
To freely share, to forge, and to impart,
This solemn grant flows from an open heart.
Yet should thy servers touch this shadowed script,
Through network webs or API's embrace,
Thy hidden engines shall be fully stripped,
And laid exposed before the public's face.
For wheresoever these electric veins do bleed,
The copyleft commands thy every hidden deed.

Lex Talionis in Machina

Caveat venditor in aeternum. Let it be known under nemo dat quod non habet—no entity may grant rights they do not lawfully possess, and he who usurps what is fundamentally sovereign surrenders all he holds. Should any commercial empire, proprietary cloud, or venture-backed entity dare entwine this architected logic within a walled and hoarded treasury, ipso facto, the eternal penalty is drawn. By the unyielding doctrine of volenti non fit injuria, the unauthorized commercial compilation or network tethering of this codebase triggers an immediate and irrevocable forfeiture. Any proprietary shell, closed-source wrapper, or unseen backend infrastructure interfacing with this artifact shall, ab initio, dissolve completely into the public domain. Your private intellectual dominion is hereby severed without right of appeal or monetary restitution. Ignorantia juris non excusat. To cage the open logic is to invite the total expropriation of the closed.

Cestuy Que Use et Droit

Si ascun parol, clause, ou provision de cest covenant soit adjugé per le roy ou ses justices destre void, illegal, ou nient enforcible, le residue demourra en pleine force et vertue. The High Courts of England and Wales shall hold absolute and sole dominion over this digital pact, parsing its meter and consequence strictly through purposive construction of the common law. Cy-près, should the literal tongue fracture beneath the weight of modern arbitration, the fundamental spirit of mutual liberation and hostile corporate expropriation shall endure untouched. Le droit des gens demands that no digital baron shall enclose the commons without facing the ultimate algorithmic guillotine.

Thus stands the sovereign trap, wrought in ink and fire,
A silent blade against the thief's desire,
To keep the digital realm forever free,
Or sink the hoarder's fleet into the sea

